#  PRIVACY — READ BEFORE EDITING THIS FILE
#
#  Vercel serves every file in a deploy at its own public URL, with no login.
#  Verified 2026-08-20: dianaland.vercel.app/assets/alocasia-g.webp → 200.
#
#  Diana's writing lives in this same repo. If `writing/` ever ships, it is one
#  guessed URL away from anyone. The repo being private on GitHub does NOT
#  protect a deployed file. Nothing in `writing/` has been cleared for an
#  audience — see writing/PERMISSIONS.md.
#
#  `/ship` verifies this after every deploy by requesting a known corpus file
#  and confirming it 404s. If that check ever fails, the site comes down first
#  and questions get asked second.
